WEBVTT

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:01.030
Ichi-san came.

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:04.750
Why are you smiling?

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:09.370
Ichi does come from time to time to ask about Masa.

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:10.790
Speaking of which...

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:13.590
Masa just keeps getting worse.

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:15.270
He’s getting thinner.

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:17.430
And he can’t stand up, let alone walk.

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:19.710
He might have to return to his birthplace.

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:22.620
Did you tell him all that?

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:23.940
You’re mean.

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:29.310
Ichi will never go to the old man’s place if I don’t tell him that.

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:36.180
Don’t you think he has a reason why he doesn’t want to go?

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:39.860
He’s the one who said he’d go just this once.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:42.590
He simply thinks it’s a pain.

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:56.500
I see.

00:02:57.410 --> 00:03:01.040
Now I know why you haven’t shown your face even once.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:05.970
Yaichi...

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:11.390
It was you all along, wasn’t it?

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:17.520
It was you all along, wasn’t it?

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:30.740
Are you coming, Masa?

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:31.720
Yes.

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:37.200
I thank you for everything.

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:39.400
Come again anytime.

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:51.840
Yaichi.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:55.970
The remnants of the Bakuro clan will soon be finishing

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:59.100
and returning from their term on the island.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:02.640
They’ll probably show themselves before you.

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:05.060
I hope you take care.

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:14.790
Hopefully, he’ll avoid Senkichi’s fate.

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.380
Yaichi-dono.

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:19.410
Hmm?

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:23.620
So this is not the first time you’ve met the old man?

00:04:24.090 --> 00:04:27.000
I’ve heard as much from Ume-dono.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.820
Ume told me you were so gaunt that you couldn’t stand,

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:34.060
and you might leave for your birthplace.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.930
I quickly knew it was a lie.

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:42.900
I also asked about the crew called the “Kuhei of Bakuro.”

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:46.900
The old man spoke with his friend about them.

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:49.900
Oh?

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:54.780
Didn’t you realize that the subject of the conversation had changed?

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:00.530
I am unrefined.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:08.770
Do not mention that name in front of anyone else.

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:12.350
He is my boss.

00:05:17.350 --> 00:05:23.230
So, did that satisfy your need
to know about my background?

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:26.980
The reason why you became a thief was unclear,

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:31.930
but I thought there was more behind that story.

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:35.450
I didn’t believe you just became a thief.

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:44.300
Did I say something?

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:45.830
Nope.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:51.740
I don’t care about the past.

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:56.720
Compared to where I came from, I like where I am now.

00:05:57.950 --> 00:06:00.310
And I want to keep it that way.

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:03.270
That’s why I enjoy myself now.

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:06.590
That’s... all there is to it.

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:19.990
It’s snowing.

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:37.590
I want to convey my thanks for your concern.

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:39.840
What about Ichi?

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:43.140
He has returned to Katsuraya for now.

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:46.250
So he actually went?

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:59.530
The city of Edo has really become lively.

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:05.620
The peaceful month I spent at the old man’s place was like being back home.

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:08.810
I don’t care about the past.

00:07:09.710 --> 00:07:13.550
I wish I could share his way of thinking.

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:18.050
Then, I could return to my birthplace with peace of mind.

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:21.800
Even if my personality isn’t befitting a warrior...

00:07:25.390 --> 00:07:26.340
I apologize.

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.810
Watch where you’re standing!

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:33.270
You! You were that tall guy!

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:35.530
Have we met before?

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:38.820
You ran into me in the city.

00:07:39.210 --> 00:07:41.570
Oh, that time?

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:44.220
Today, you’re not getting a free pass!

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:46.040
Draw!

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:47.780
Uh, no! I mean...

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:49.000
Just draw!

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:52.090
Drawing katanas in this place...

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:53.000
Quiet!

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:55.920
This certainly isn’t the right place, brother.

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:58.470
Let’s see...

00:07:58.470 --> 00:08:00.700
Hey, you kids.

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:05.160
It’s a match between two ronins!

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:07.020
But with wooden swords!

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:08.710
Looks exciting!

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:14.940
Hurry and take your stance!

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:17.530
What are ya doing? Begin already!

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:28.200
Are you just some doofus? Huh?

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:30.790
Hey, he’s trembling!

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:34.080
And he was protecting a delicate man before.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.460
Geez, he’s not moving.

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:38.300
It’s gonna get dark soon!

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:44.800
Get a grip, Masanosuke!

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:46.600
What are you doing?

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:49.300
Can’t you get your act together before our lord?

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:52.000
What have you been learning up till now?

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:55.590
I’ve never seen such a coward in my life.

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:57.540
Quit being a samurai!

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:00.290
Some samurai he is!

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:08.700
You’re pathetic, elder brother.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:27.340
I ran away again.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:35.650
So, nothing has changed since I was at home?

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:37.940
It will never change.

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:41.650
I shall live out my life being told to get my act together while people laugh at me.

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:44.420
Just like in the past.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.760
Don’t worry about what happened.

00:09:56.510 --> 00:09:57.880
Yaki-dono?

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:05.650
I conducted myself shamefully.

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:13.270
Are you really a samurai?

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:15.810
Y-Yes, I am!

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:27.330
“One Who Picks Leaves,” you are the kind of man as you appear.

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:33.950
What happened to being a bodyguard?

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:35.500
Were you forced into downtime?

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:42.460
Why don’t you visit a dojo or something?

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:45.950
Dojos do not suit me.

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:47.520
Why not?

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:50.460
There are so many people, and...

00:10:50.470 --> 00:10:54.310
Okay, shall I show you to an empty dojo?

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:55.320
Huh?

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:56.620
My place.

00:10:57.870 --> 00:10:59.940
You maintain a dojo?

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:03.790
Nope, I’m just offering to be your sparring partner.

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.430
He seems powerful.

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:11.480
However, I’m on my way to a small restaurant now.

00:11:11.780 --> 00:11:13.480
You can join me if you want.

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:32.320
Do you have a goal?

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:33.860
Like becoming a samurai again?

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:35.990
In a sense.

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:39.470
But with this personality of mine...

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:45.510
He is shorter than me.

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:49.980
Yet from a distance he seems bigger than me.

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:56.940
The composure of his spirit is amazing to behold.

00:11:56.940 --> 00:12:00.650
I was impressed by it again today.

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:08.510
But again, I’ve come to realize how truly puerile I am.

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:12.740
So your goal is to be that man?

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:21.930
I don’t think that’s it.

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:25.580
It’s just...

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:35.880
...that a part of me is jealous of him.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:42.160
Here. Some hard candy.

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:45.070
I see you’ve thought of me.

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:47.910
It is my gratitude for your care.

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:54.460
Did you also come because of Yaichi?

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:58.450
That is also one of my reasons.

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:02.380
How did you come to know him?

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:05.160
We had one encounter long ago.

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:11.080
I don’t speak much of it, Masa.

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:15.740
He must have come knowing that fact.

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:19.730
Then, what about the Kuhei crew from Bakuro?

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:21.860
May I ask of them?

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:24.990
Are they still around?

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:28.550
I heard their decapitated heads were put on display.

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:31.750
The remaining few were exiled to an island.

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:34.790
It seems he was the one who escaped justice.

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:41.290
Then, he started the Five Leaves, severing any allegiance to his former crew.

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:44.640
I’m guessing you’ll be taking extra precautions?

00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:46.670
Against the remnants of that crew?

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:51.010
Against Yaichi.

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:56.680
It might be useless to worry.

00:13:57.930 --> 00:14:00.860
It seems he has abandoned his past.

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:04.610
Still, there are some concerns.

00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:11.550
Perhaps I should talk to Ume-dono about Yaichi-dono?

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:13.550
You should.

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:18.290
It’s better that he knows a little more about who he is now.

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:20.400
Who he is now?

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:29.060
Masa. You must keep a close watch in order to protect yourself.

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:46.340
I’ll never know if you’re useful for anything if you keep swinging that wooden sword.

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:50.070
But if I don’t train, even like this...

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:56.410
Maybe I’ll get lucky and some yakuza will come.

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:03.960
Ichi, take him on.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:09.670
Madam, I only have a dagger on me.

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:14.470
You’d win even with that, Ichi.

00:15:14.900 --> 00:15:17.490
You really that weak.

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:19.720
I can sense it from here.

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:24.440
Only use your left arm.

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:28.800
Dealing with this after recovering from an illness?

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:30.400
It must be hard for you.

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:34.680
Well, I guess we should do something to entertain her.

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:36.810
I’m a busy woman, you know.

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:39.620
Um, and I may not use my right hand?

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:43.540
All you need to do is to lightly
knock the dagger from my hand.

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:45.950
Easy, right?

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:16.490
Wait.

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:20.350
You’re supposed to use the wooden sword.

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:26.500
Why are you pulling out your katana?

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:27.920
Well...

00:16:28.720 --> 00:16:31.460
Daichi-dono’s vigor got the best of me.

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:32.650
Honestly.

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:35.040
Ooh! Come here, everybody!

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:37.670
Ichi-san and Sensei are going at it!

00:16:40.110 --> 00:16:43.120
P-Please don’t let anyone come!

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:49.070
You faced some ronin the other
day only to run away, remember?

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:51.610
I heard it from the hairdresser.

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:54.570
How pathetic.

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:03.730
Hey, you all should leave!

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:08.190
Masa.

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:09.040
Huh?

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:13.920
Aren’t you treating me a bit strangely?

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:19.750
When he said that...

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:26.920
It is true that I am not confident I could win.

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:32.280
And I think my skills have become dull lately.

00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:38.740
Training, huh?

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.630
The dojo?

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:54.650
Sorry, but could we do that another time?

00:17:56.930 --> 00:17:58.840
I am making a grave visit.

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:03.980
You do this a lot, don’t you?

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:04.810
Hmm?

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:10.770
Oh, I mean... you also had flowers the first time we met.

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:15.070
That was the anniversary of my wife’s death.

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:17.990
Today is for someone else.

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:43.870
Shall we go?

00:18:45.210 --> 00:18:46.880
And the remaining flowers?

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:49.720
They’re for the next grave.

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:02.590
That other grave is for my neighbor’s son.

00:19:04.110 --> 00:19:06.620
He died from an epidemic disease.

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:09.380
It happened quite a while ago.

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:13.650
This one here died around the same time.

00:19:14.350 --> 00:19:18.180
He had no relatives, so no one except me visits him.

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:25.640
If you’d like, you can help me out.

00:19:26.360 --> 00:19:30.270
I have more death anniversaries
coming up, so I’ll be making more visits.

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:37.120
Today is his death anniversary.

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:40.680
He was a foolish man.

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:43.530
He stumbled around at night and fell into a well.

00:19:43.940 --> 00:19:46.170
But he was a good friend.

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:50.040
Yaichi.

00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:58.310
Yaichi?

00:20:09.280 --> 00:20:13.250
Forgive me, Matsukichi-san. I’ve kept you waiting again.

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:17.830
It’s okay. You were busy.

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:21.750
And you were kind enough to give me your time.

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:26.920
Please accept this.

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:37.370
Did something happen?

00:20:38.010 --> 00:20:42.210
Oh, no. It does not involve you.

00:20:43.850 --> 00:20:49.060
I have two benefactors to whom I will forever lower my head.

00:20:50.300 --> 00:20:52.430
You are one of them.

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:56.430
So, did something happen?

00:21:08.940 --> 00:21:16.140
I’ve got a feeling that something was hidden

00:21:16.140 --> 00:21:25.430
in the words you once told me. Those words cross my mind again and again.

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:33.850
Yet your voice always sounds the same as before.

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:40.900
Every time I breathe, I wanna hold you in my arms

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:49.830
Every words you whispered makes my heart beat up and high

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:57.910
Every time I breathe, I just wanna hold you in my arms again

00:21:59.030 --> 00:22:06.730
Every words you whispered makes my heart beat up and high

00:22:07.390 --> 00:22:14.970
Every day I need you  All the time I'll be there for you

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:24.080
Every words you whispered makes my heart beat up and high

00:22:30.340 --> 00:22:33.200
Next time on House of Five Leaves:

00:22:33.200 --> 00:22:35.250
My name is Masanosuke.

00:22:35.250 --> 00:22:38.390
I have no steady employment, and I have not regained my status as a samurai.

00:22:38.390 --> 00:22:41.190
Though I am always adrift in life,

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:44.940
I do feel something good on the horizon. How troubling.

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:48.010
Well then, the next episode’s title is:

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:49.990
“I Have Two Benefactors.”
